{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>無綫《萬千星輝賀台慶》今晚（19日）在電視城舉行，在終極大抽獎環節，曾參加《中年好聲音》的顏志恒獲得台慶大獎，個人獨取信用卡免找數簽賬額總值45萬。另外，張與辰、高海寧分別奪得萬千星輝賀台慶紅地氈最佳甫士男、女藝人。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T15:19:15.038327+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":108,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T14:38:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T09:37:37.930335+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T15:12:41.139186+00:00","content_hash":"8e49c7ca98880e2f8ad680b2846a9d51af9639cef60623d86f9c6fea0bdd0447","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}